#: data/org.gnome.Characters.appdata.xml.in:9
msgid ""
"Characters is a simple utility application to find and insert unusual "
"characters. It allows you to quickly find the character you are looking for "
"by searching for keywords."
msgstr ""
"Karakteri su jednostavna aplikacija za pronalazak i umetanje neobicnih "
"karaktera. Dozvoljava vam da brzo nadjete karaktere koje trazite preko "
"kljucnih rijeci."

#: data/org.gnome.Characters.appdata.xml.in:12
msgid ""
"You can also browse characters by categories, such as Punctuation, Pictures, "
"etc."
msgstr ""
"Takodjer mozete traziti karaktere po kategorijama kao Punctuation, Pictures, "
"itd"

#: data/org.gnome.Characters.desktop.in.in:5
msgid "Utility application to find and insert unusual characters"
msgstr "Aplikacija za pronalazak i ubacivanje neobicnih znakova"

